      "subject": "נח\/ינחמנו",
      "rationale": "Nem Noak (נח) i singaut long tok ינחמנו (em bai trautim mipela) — nem i kamap tok, wanpela tingting i lus liklik long Tok Pisin."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "trautim",
      "rationale": "נחם em i winim traut tasol — em i tok bilong win i kam bek, pen i lait; 'trautim' i klostu tasol."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "i",
      "rationale": "Tok Pisin i mas avim wanpela tok bilong helpim krosim tru; Hibru i no gat em."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na em i senisim nem bilong ⟨את⟩ em i Noak, na tok olsem: Dispela bai i trautim mipela long wok bilong mipela, na long pen bilong han bilong mipela, long graun we Yahwe i krosim ⟨i⟩ tru.",
